OL,3,AOne dead after torrential rain and
OL,4,Aflash floods hit Barcelona region
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth-eastern Spain has been hit by
OL,7,Ftorrential rain and flash floods,
OL,8,Fleaving one person dead and causing
OL,9,Fwidespread disruption across the
OL,10,Fregion.
OL,12,FSpain's national weather agency AEMET
OL,13,Fissued warnings for heavy rain across
OL,14,Feastern regions on Wednesday, including
OL,15,Fa red alert for Barcelona's coastline.
OL,17,FRescuers recovered the body of a man on
OL,18,FThursday in Olivella, around 40km (25
OL,19,Fmiles) west of Barcelona, after his car
OL,20,Fwas swept away by a stream, authorities
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
