OL,3,AOne dead after torrential rain and
OL,4,Aflash floods hit Barcelona region
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deluge has disrupted travel across
OL,7,FCatalonia and Valencia, with flights
OL,8,Fcancelled and roads submerged.
OL,9,FAuthorities have advised against
OL,10,Funnecessary travel, while Prime
OL,11,FMinister Pedro Sanchez warned of "very
OL,12,Fcomplicated situations".
